/* A safety property whose only counterexample is 75 steps long: counting
   up from 0 reaches 75.  Invalid.  Spacer needs about 15 seconds for it on
   one core, so a reduction that gives its clause solver one fixed 10-second
   budget answers timeout whatever the caller allows. */
forall (x: int). x != 0 \/ I x
s.t.
I (x: int): bool =nu x != 75 /\ I (x + 1);
